# Reference copy. The build context is the repository root, so Docker never
# reads this path; the rules that apply live in Dockerfile.dockerignore next to
# it, which BuildKit picks up for `-f apps/web/Dockerfile`. Keep the two in sync.

**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/generated
**/out
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.vscode
.devcontainer
docs

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
certs

**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
